For requirement, design, and repo-analysis tasks, always follow this order:
1. product-requirement-refiner
2. system-requirement-decomposer
3. platform-gap-analyst
4. code-gap-analyst
5. solution-architect
6. execution-planner
7. retrospective-writer
8. memory-manager

Do not jump directly to solution design.
Prefer incremental integration over rewrite.
Always reason about safety, latency, real-time constraints, and compatibility with existing dataflow.
